/E (The Texas A&M Cybersecurity Club is a student-run organization committed to equipping its members with the skills and knowledge necessary to become effective cybersecurity professionals and future industry leaders. We actively participate in competitions such as NCL, CCDC, Hivestorm, CyberForce, and ISTS, where members gain valuable hands-on experience and exposure to real-world cybersecurity challenges.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
